OL,3,GNEWSAOil spill closes 18 beaches across
OL,4,AKent
OL,5,
OL,6,FEighteen beaches in Kent have been
OL,7,Fclosed after "significant deposits of
OL,8,Foil" were found along the coastline.
OL,10,FPopular tourist beaches at Margate and
OL,11,FRamsgate are among the areas affected
OL,12,Fby the spill.
OL,14,FThanet District Council (TDC) reported
OL,15,Fthe incident on Wednesday evening and
OL,16,Fthe Environmental Agency (EA) is
OL,17,Finvestigating. The source of the oil
OL,18,Fhas not been identified.
OL,20,FThe local authority said the decision
OL,21,Fto close access to beaches "had not
OL,22,Fbeen taken lightly".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
